WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.223 --> 00:00:17.784
When the other students went to bed that night, Wukong stayed awake.

2
00:00:19.325 --> 00:00:23.266
At three o'clock in the morning, he crept quietly through the dark temple.

3
00:00:24.306 --> 00:00:25.787
He entered Subodhi's room.

4
00:00:29.748 --> 00:00:30.728
what are you doing here?"

5
00:00:31.152 --> 00:00:32.073
asked the sage.

6
00:00:32.093 --> 00:00:35.834
"I understood your secret message," said the monkey.

7
00:00:35.854 --> 00:00:38.896
"You hit me on the head three times.

8
00:00:39.956 --> 00:00:42.237
That meant you wanted me to visit you at three o'clock.

9
00:00:43.378 --> 00:00:45.418
Now will you teach me how to live forever?"

10
00:00:46.439 --> 00:00:47.499
Subodhi smiled.

11
00:00:47.519 --> 00:00:49.920
"I knew you were a worthy student.

12
00:00:50.681 --> 00:00:51.321
Come closer."

13
00:00:55.163 --> 00:00:57.504
Subodhi whispered into Wukong's ear.

14
00:00:58.572 --> 00:01:03.413
The sage whispered prayers as well as secret formulas about the universe and nature.

15
00:01:04.514 --> 00:01:09.395
As the monkey listened to his teacher's words, powerful light filled the room.

16
00:01:12.336 --> 00:01:15.417
Now Wukong knew how to live forever!

17
00:01:18.477 --> 00:01:22.859
For the next few years, Wukong meditated and practiced the secret formulas.

18
00:01:23.779 --> 00:01:27.140
While the other students slept at night, Wukong stayed up.

19
00:01:28.368 --> 00:01:33.371
Soon his mind and body were powerful, and he could change shape or size.

20
00:01:35.632 --> 00:01:42.496
He could turn into other animals and soar through the sky on clouds.

21
00:01:46.478 --> 00:01:49.000
One day all the students were sitting outside.

22
00:01:49.020 --> 00:01:52.561
"Wukong," said one student.

23
00:01:52.581 --> 00:01:54.182
"You have been busy lately."

24
00:01:55.023 --> 00:01:56.944
"It's true," said another student.

25
00:01:57.640 --> 00:01:58.661
"What have you been doing?"

26
00:01:58.681 --> 00:02:03.525
"I've been meditating and practicing secret formulas," said Wukong.

27
00:02:03.545 --> 00:02:05.627
"Secret formulas?"

28
00:02:06.007 --> 00:02:07.068
said the first student.

29
00:02:08.509 --> 00:02:10.070
looked very interested.

30
00:02:10.851 --> 00:02:12.773
They leaned in closer to Wukong.

31
00:02:12.833 --> 00:02:15.375
"Yes," said the monkey.

32
00:02:15.395 --> 00:02:17.336
"Our master told them to me."

33
00:02:17.356 --> 00:02:19.478
"He did?"

34
00:02:19.798 --> 00:02:20.619
said a student.

35
00:02:20.639 --> 00:02:22.401
"You must be special.

36
00:02:23.081 --> 00:02:24.762
doesn't tell everyone those formulas.

37
00:02:25.543 --> 00:02:27.532
What did he teach you?"

38
00:02:27.632 --> 00:02:28.572
Wukong smiled.

39
00:02:28.592 --> 00:02:30.753
"He taught me how to live forever.

40
00:02:31.733 --> 00:02:33.934
He also taught me how to change into other things."

41
00:02:33.954 --> 00:02:37.735
"Show us what you can do," said the student.

42
00:02:39.315 --> 00:02:39.775
stood up.

43
00:02:40.596 --> 00:02:43.797
He muttered a quick spell and made a sign with his hands.

44
00:02:46.857 --> 00:02:47.838
The monkey was gone.

45
00:02:48.858 --> 00:02:51.619
An enormous pine tree stood in his place.

46
00:02:53.459 --> 00:02:54.960
voice came from the tree.

47
00:02:54.980 --> 00:02:57.236
"What do you think?"

48
00:02:57.316 --> 00:02:58.957
The students clapped and cheered.

49
00:02:58.977 --> 00:03:00.837
"That's amazing!"

50
00:03:01.117 --> 00:03:01.637
said one.

51
00:03:01.657 --> 00:03:04.638
"The monkey is truly powerful!"

52
00:03:04.958 --> 00:03:05.518
said another.

53
00:03:07.179 --> 00:03:08.899
noise disturbed Subodhi.

54
00:03:11.640 --> 00:03:14.581
He ran outside and saw the enormous pine tree.

55
00:03:14.641 --> 00:03:16.921
"What's going on out here?"

56
00:03:17.341 --> 00:03:17.882
he shouted.

57
00:03:19.542 --> 00:03:20.382
stopped cheering.

58
00:03:20.942 --> 00:03:23.303
Wukong quickly turned back into himself.

59
00:03:24.403 --> 00:03:26.444
Subodhi's eyes flashed with anger.

60
00:03:27.604 --> 00:03:29.645
"Everyone but Wukong, go inside!"

61
00:03:29.925 --> 00:03:30.426
he yelled.

62
00:03:31.546 --> 00:03:34.048
Subodhi waited for the other students to leave.

63
00:03:39.410 --> 00:03:42.772
taught you the secret formulas so you could live forever," said the sage.

64
00:03:43.933 --> 00:03:45.374
"Not so you could show off!"

65
00:03:46.494 --> 00:03:48.095
"I'm sorry," said Wukong.

66
00:03:48.115 --> 00:03:51.477
"I—" kept talking.

67
00:03:51.497 --> 00:03:54.318
"Now all of the students have seen what you can do.

68
00:03:55.439 --> 00:03:56.980
They will want to know how to do it too!

69
00:03:58.096 --> 00:04:00.118
If you don't tell them, they might harm you.

70
00:04:01.759 --> 00:04:03.501
not safe for you to stay here anymore.

71
00:04:05.402 --> 00:04:06.103
You must go."

72
00:04:08.364 --> 00:04:09.425
started to cry.

73
00:04:09.445 --> 00:04:11.107
"But, Master!

74
00:04:11.627 --> 00:04:12.408
Where will I go?"

75
00:04:12.488 --> 00:04:15.390
"Go back home," said Subodhi.

76
00:04:16.731 --> 00:04:18.332
"But you taught me so many things!"

77
00:04:18.653 --> 00:04:19.313
said the monkey.

78
00:04:19.333 --> 00:04:21.575
"I must repay you first."

79
00:04:21.595 --> 00:04:24.898
"You don't need to repay me," said Subodhi.

80
00:04:26.019 --> 00:04:27.620
"Just try to stay out of trouble."

81
00:04:28.736 --> 00:04:31.078
The sage looked at Wukong for a moment.

82
00:04:34.741 --> 00:04:38.184
Then he said, "I can see that you will do evil things someday.

83
00:04:39.245 --> 00:04:40.946
Don't tell anyone you were my student.

84
00:04:41.867 --> 00:04:42.327
Now go."

85
00:04:43.488 --> 00:04:44.970
Wukong hung his head.

86
00:04:44.990 --> 00:04:46.451
"Good-bye, Master."

87
00:04:50.114 --> 00:04:52.436
He leaped onto a cloud and left.

88
00:04:58.024 --> 00:05:02.248
After a short journey, Wukong arrived at the Fruit and Flower Mountain.

89
00:05:06.311 --> 00:05:07.292
have returned!"

90
00:05:07.692 --> 00:05:08.253
he called.

91
00:05:11.355 --> 00:05:12.276
gibbon ran to him.

92
00:05:12.296 --> 00:05:14.898
"Your Majesty!

93
00:05:15.479 --> 00:05:16.299
Something terrible has
